WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.877
Wakkati ɗuɗɗi, nder Sahel, go'o debbo biyeteeɗo Samba jooɗii.

00:00:04.957 --> 00:00:09.834
Baabiraawo maako hokki mo kuuje maako, ngam ɗe ɗe'e ko'e mum.

00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:18.610
Kaŋko o acci mo, sey o wi'i mo: "To a wurtini dabbaaji maaɗa fuu, a yejjita, ndiyam ɗam naa' ɗum nyaamduɗo".

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.023
Haa saa'i maajum sa'aare ɓillaare mawnini.

00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:27.142
Ɗuum waɗi ndiyam ɓaawo ndiyam ɓadake, leɗɗe boo laati cembiɗam.

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:34.862
Ngam maajum Samba ɓeydi ɓeydaago nder nyalawma fuu, ngam baali maako ɗon nyaama, ɓe ɗon nyaami.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:41.119
Nder jemma go'oto, o yi'i diga nder dunes ɗiɗo, haa o heɓii daande ɗon heewi.

00:00:41.199 --> 00:00:45.100
Ɗuum ndiyam ɗon laaɓta, ɓadake ɓadugo nder lewru.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:01:00.134
Nde dabbaaji mum'en ɗon njahi nder ndiyam, wolde mawnde ƴetti diga ndiyam, wi'i: "Moye ɓadataa ɓaduki debbo am?" Sey o yi'i gooduɗo baawɗe, o mawnini bana baobab, o heewi ɓerɗe njamndi.

00:01:00.214 --> 00:01:04.359
Samba huli masin, ammaa o siftori bolle mawɗo maako.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:10.454
O hokki yamiroore maako booɗɗum, o toroo ngam o hokkamo kuuje maako ndiyam.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:21.180
Ammaa o wi'i, "Ndan, ammaa ko waɗi ko tati: to dabbaaji mon poyi maayo am, to a halki ndiyam am, ammaa a acca ɗum ngam ɓaawo maaɗa".

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:27.031
Samba hokki baali maako ndiyam go'oto go'to, o hokkiɓe ndiyam dow maayo.

00:01:27.111 --> 00:01:29.225
O ɗon heewa tan ko'e maako.

00:01:29.305 --> 00:01:32.800
Nde subaka, seyjo go'oto wari e baali mawɗi.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:39.057
O ɗon moƴƴina haala kaalankooɓe ɓe'e, o wurtina dabbaaji maako fuu nder le'i.

00:01:39.137 --> 00:01:42.470
Ɗon e ɗon ɓooyaaki, ndiyam ɓeydi ɓeydaaki.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:46.452
Sey mawɗo mawɗo ɓe'e wari, ɓerɗe maako ɗon maaya.

00:01:46.532 --> 00:01:50.758
O wi'i Samba: "An, a ɗon mawnina ndiyam, a heɓayɗum".

00:01:50.838 --> 00:01:57.341
Ɓe mbi'i: "To sahaa fuɗnaare fuu, Samba heɓii saŋgeere heewi nder nokkuure go'o".

00:01:57.421 --> 00:02:04.898
Nde o mawni, o wi'i ɓikkoy maako bolle mawɗo maako, o ɓeydi bolle maako: "Ndam woni nyamndu".

00:02:04.978 --> 00:02:06.767
To a torra mo, o dilli.
